768	/**
769	 * Soft-delete conventions.
770	 *
771	 * Issues, projects and comments are never physically removed — they get an
772	 * `archived_at` timestamp. Repositories must express "live rows only" through
773	 * these helpers so the predicate stays in one place; a raw
774	 * `isNull(table.archivedAt)` sprinkled through the data layer is exactly the
775	 * drift this module prevents.
